@baseUrl = https://localhost:7295
@tenantToken = THAY_BANG_JWT_TENANT
@landlordToken = THAY_BANG_JWT_LANDLORD
@propertyId = THAY_BANG_GUID_CAN_NHA_DA_DUYET
@conversationId = THAY_BANG_GUID_HOI_THOAI
@messageId = THAY_BANG_GUID_TIN_NHAN
@attachmentId = THAY_BANG_GUID_TEP

### 1. Tenant tao hoac lay hoi thoai theo can nha
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/properties/{{propertyId}}/conversation
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 2. Tenant/landlord xem danh sach hoi thoai chua an (phan trang server-side)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 2a. Xem trang tiep theo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations?page=2&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 2b. Xem ca hoi thoai da an (van phan trang)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations?includeArchived=true&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 2c. Kiem tra tham so phan trang khong hop le (mong doi 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations?page=0&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 3. Xem lich su tin nhan (phan trang server-side)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages?page=1&pageSize=30
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 3a. Kiem tra pageSize vuot gioi han (mong doi 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages?page=1&pageSize=101
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 4. Gui tin nhan van ban
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Xin chao, toi muon hoi them ve can nha."
}

### 5. Sua tin nhan cua chinh minh
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Noi dung da duoc cap nhat."
}

### 6. Xoa mem tin nhan cua chinh minh
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 7. Danh dau da doc
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 8. An hoi thoai khoi danh sach ca nhan
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isArchived": true
}

### 9. Hien lai hoi thoai
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isArchived": false
}

### 10. Tai tep dinh kem (doi duong dan den tep local truoc khi gui)
# VS Code REST Client: thay duong dan file ben duoi bang tep thu nghiem.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/attachments
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----ChatBoundary

------ChatBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="caption"

Tai lieu dinh kem
------ChatBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
------ChatBoundary--

### 11. Tai tep (chi participant duoc phep)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/attachments/{{attachmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### SignalR
# Ket noi /hubs/chat bang accessTokenFactory, sau do:
# connection.invoke("JoinConversation", conversationId)
# Lang nghe NhanTinNhan, SuaTinNhan, XoaTinNhan
# Roi hoi thoai: connection.invoke("LeaveConversation", conversationId)
